-chave, área, modalidade e, se artigo, os dados do artigo) → botão Continuar (salva) →&lt;br&gt;passo 2 Orientação (orientador e coorientador) → botão Continuar (salva) → passo 3 Revisar e enviar. &amp;quot;Salvar rascunho&amp;quot; salva sem mudar de passo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color="#2e7d32"&gt;Sequência conferida no sistema: mesma ordem de telas, cliques e chamadas à API.&lt;/font&gt;' style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#f7f9fc;strokeColor=#9fb3cf;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="64" width="2712" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s0-1-4" value="&lt;b&gt;Aluno&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=umlActor;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.6;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="100" y="150" width="30" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s0-1-5" value='&lt;b&gt;TEL05 Cadastro de TCC&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:10px" color="#555555"&gt;/tccs/cadastro&lt;/font&gt;' style="shape=umlBoundary;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#4a6fa5;strokeWidth=1.6;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="403" y="150" width="50" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s0-1-6" value='&lt;b&gt;ControladorTccs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:10px" color="#555555"&gt;routes/tccs.py&lt;/font&gt;' style="shape=umlControl;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#5b8f3e;strokeWidth=1.6;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="715" y="150" width="40" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s0-1-7" value="&lt;b&gt;MatriculaTurma&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=umlEntity;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#b8962e;strok