y"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s9-3-3" value='&lt;b&gt;Caminho na tela:&lt;/b&gt; abrir o link do e-mail → /ativar?token= (conta nova) ou /redefinir-senha?token= (esqueci a senha) → a tela confere o link → informar e confirmar a&lt;br&gt;senha → botão &amp;quot;Ativar conta&amp;quot; ou &amp;quot;Salvar nova senha&amp;quot; → TEL01 Entrar&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color="#2e7d32"&gt;Sequência conferida no sistema: mesma ordem de telas, cliques e chamadas à API.&lt;/font&gt;' style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#f7f9fc;strokeColor=#9fb3cf;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="64" width="1561" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s9-3-4" value='&lt;b&gt;Pessoa cadastrada&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:10px" color="#555555"&gt;ainda sem senha&lt;/font&gt;' style="shape=umlActor;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.6;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="115" y="150" width="30" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s9-3-5" value='&lt;b&gt;TEL01 Ativar conta / Nova senha&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:10px" color="#555555"&gt;/ativar · /redefinir-senha&lt;/font&gt;' style="shape=umlBoundary;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#4a6fa5;strokeWidth=1.6;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="411" y="150" width="50" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s9-3-6" value='&lt;b&gt;TEL01 Entrar&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:10px" color="#555555"&gt;/entrar&lt;/font&gt;' style="shape=umlBoundary;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#4a6fa5;strokeWidth=1.6;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="681" y="150" width="50" height="44" as="geometry"/><